      "errata": [],
      "rowMap": [
        {
          "mdLine": 34,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p cont -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "在任何一点可以微分的函数在这一点是连续的（九年级"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 35,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p cont -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "第 45 小节）. 于是，函数 $\\ln$ 在区间 $]0,\\infty[$ 内每一点都连续."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 38,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "2. 函数 $\\ln$ 在区间 $]0,\\infty[$ 上上升. 实际上，在区间 $]0,\\infty[$"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 39,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "上，$\\ln' x=\\frac{1}{x}>0$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 42,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "3. $\\ln1=\\int_1^1\\frac{1}{x}dx=0$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 45,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "4.（加法定理.）对于任何的 $a>0$ 和 $b>0$，"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 46,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln(ab)=\\ln a+\\ln b$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 49,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "为了证明它，我们讨论函数"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 50,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "$g(x)=\\ln(ax)$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 53,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "它的导函数 $g'$ 根据复合函数的导函数公式计算："
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 54,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "$g'(x)=\\frac{1}{ax}\\cdot(ax)'=\\frac{1}{ax}\\cdot a=\\frac{1}{x}$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 57,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "因此，函数 $\\ln(ax)$ 是函数 $\\frac{1}{x}$ 的一个原函数，于是可以把它"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 58,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "写成"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 59,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln(ax)=\\ln x+C$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 62,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "代入等式 $x=1$，得 $\\ln a=\\ln1+C$，因此 $C=\\ln a$. 于是，"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 63,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln(ax)=\\ln a+\\ln x$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 66,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "设 $x=b$，得"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 67,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln(ab)=\\ln a+\\ln b$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 70,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "利用数学归纳法容易证明，对于任何正数 $a_1,a_2,\\cdots,a_n$，"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 71,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln(a_1\\cdot a_2\\cdot\\ldots\\cdot a_n)=\\ln a_1+\\ln a_2+\\cdots+\\ln a_n$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 74,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p open -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "5. 对于任何正数 $a$ 和 $b$，$\\ln\\frac{a}{b}=\\ln a-\\ln b$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 77,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- foot -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "• 163 •"
        }
      ]
    },
