      "rowMap": [
        {
          "mdLine": 35,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p cont -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "实际上，$\\ln a=\\ln\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\cdot b\\right)=\\ln\\frac{a}{b}+\\ln b$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 36,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p cont -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "于是，"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 37,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p cont -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln\\frac{a}{b}=\\ln a-\\ln b$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 40,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "6. 对于 $x>0$ 并且 $r\\in Q$，"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 41,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln x^r=r\\ln x$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 44,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "我们分几步进行证明."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 47,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "а) 对于 $r=0$ 和 $r=1$："
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 48,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln x^0=\\ln1=0=0\\cdot\\ln x$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 49,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln x^1=\\ln x=1\\cdot\\ln x$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 52,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "б) 对于自然数 $r>1$："
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 53,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln x^r=\\ln(\\underbrace{x\\cdots x}_{↵r\\text{ 个因数}})=\\underbrace{\\ln x+\\ln x+\\cdots+\\ln x}_{r\\text{ 项}}=r\\ln x$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 56,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "в) 对于负整数 $r$，就是 $r=-n$，这里 $n$ 是自然数，利用性"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 57,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "质 5，得到："
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 58,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "$\\ln x^r=\\ln\\frac{1}{x^n}=\\ln1-\\ln x^n=0-n\\ln x=r\\ln x$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 61,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "г) 对于 $r=\\frac{m}{n}$（$m$ 是整数，$n$ 是自然数），由于 б) 和 в)，"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 62,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "得到："
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 63,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "$n\\ln x^r=n\\ln x^{\\frac{m}{n}}=\\ln\\left(x^{\\frac{m}{n}}\\right)^n=\\ln x^m=m\\ln x$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 64,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "于是，　$\\ln x^r=\\frac{m}{n}\\ln x=r\\ln x$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 67,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "7. $E(\\ln)=R$."
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 70,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- p open -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "函数 $\\ln$ 连续. 根据第 84 小节中定理的第一部分，函数"
        },
        {
          "mdLine": 73,
          "declaredBlock": "<!-- foot -->",
          "sourceRows": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "• 164 •"
        }
      ]
